      "date": "2026-06-10T21:35:50.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.06 (vs ₹0.22 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.06 (up from ₹0.22 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹105.3m (up ₹105.1m from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.81m (up ₹8.62m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.7% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 36% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 29% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
