      "body": "Grand Foundry Limited announced that Ms. Nalini Singh has tendered her resignation from the post of Company Secretary and Compliance Officer (Key Managerial Personnel) due to personal reasons. The resignation is effective from the close of business hours on January 8, 2026. Ms. Nalini Singh requested acknowledgment of her resignation letter and arrangement to file the necessary forms with the Registrar of Companies, Ministry of Corporate Affairs, and intimation to the stock exchanges to give effect to this resignation.",
