      "title": "Grand Foundry Limited Announces CFO Changes, Effective from January 5, 2025",
      "body": "Grand Foundry Limited announced that the Board of Directors of the Company in Meeting held on 5th January, 2026 have considered and approved the resignations of Ms. Shivani Jain from the post of CFO due to her pre-occupation elsewhere and announced the appointment of Mr. Nitin Gupta as Chief Financial Officer. Nitin Gupta is a finance and accounts professional with over 14 years of extensive experience in Accounts, Finance, Taxation (Direct & Indirect), and Auditing. He holds a B.Com degree and has completed CA Inter. Currently, he has been working with Harso Steels Private Limited for the past 9 years, contributing strong expertise in financial management, compliance, and taxation. The effective date is January 5, 2025.",
